    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1669">

                <pb facs="1421" n="1317" xml:id="pg1317"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 367.114M69/125.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the American Ambassador</hi>,</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-05-15">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 15, 1912</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your May 13 and May 15. Upon receipt by the Department of the conclusions of the
                    investigations by Fowle and Upham to which you refer you will be further
                    instructed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
